Node ID=61 the bait
Text=The blue ones come at night and point at somebody and the ogres carry him out over the fence. They tell us it is to catch the thing that has been eating us. Not one of them has come back, monsieur, so either it is a very clever thing or they are very poor fishermen. My brother went out on Tuesday.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Thierry says you will follow him out. Will you?
Go to node ID=62 will you run

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will see it stopped.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=62 will you run
Text=Thierry has a plan and I have a wife who got out of this town alive, so yes. When he says run I will run until my heart bursts. And do not let anybody tell you we are cattle because we are quiet. Being afraid is not the same as being cattle.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Nobody will say it to me.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=63 the shape
Text=It had my neighbour's shape. It came to the fence in the dark and spoke with Grazide's voice and asked to be let in, and Grazide had been three days dead. The titans believe we do not know what is eating us. We know. We knew before they did.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Did it wear anything else you recognised?
Go to node ID=63 the shape 2

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Thank you. That is more than the titans could tell me.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=63 the shape 2
Text=A deer, twice, at the treeline where the ground is trampled. A deer that stood and watched the pen for an hour and did not run when the ogres shouted at it. After that I stopped looking out at night.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=A deer that does not run. That is enough to go on.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=64 the face
Text=<She looks up, and then keeps looking.> I looked away because you are the first thing to come to this fence in a week that was not hungry. Your face is your own business, monsieur, and I have a cousin the same. There is a great deal at this fence more frightening than a pair of eyes.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Has the thing that hunts you a shape?
