Node ID=65 the child
Text=The big blue one that guards us is called Poimaino and he is the stupid one. Another one brings him silver to drink and then they both go away and nobody watches us at all, not one of them. I have counted it four times. It is the only thing I have to do in here.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You have been very useful. Sit down and stay quiet.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=66 the child and the devil
Text=...Are you a devil? Maman says devils are made up to frighten children who will not sleep. But I have watched a blue giant eat a whole sheep and a man walk out of that gate and never come back, so I do not think anybody has been telling me the truth about anything. You are less frightening than they are. You are the right size.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I am the right size. Sit down and stay quiet.
Go to node ID=
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=557 trampled ground
Text=The ground in this dead end is churned to mud, and something has been standing in it long enough to leave more than footprints.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=558 the deer
Text=Deer slots, pressed deep, with no stride between them: whatever left these stood on two legs in a deer's feet.
Should Have Voiceover=0
